Modifications by PocketAI:
  - Added llama.cpp `LLM_ARCH_TALKIE` architecture and graph builder
    (`llama.cpp/src/models/talkie.cpp`).
  - PyTorch checkpoint → GGUF converter (`scripts/convert_to_gguf.py`)
    that folds talkie's gain scalars into adjacent linear weights and
    stores per-layer scalars (`embed_skip_scale`, `attn_q_gain`).
  - Reference-logits validation tooling under `validation/`.
  - Metal backend env var (`GGML_METAL_NE11_MM_MIN`) in
    `llama.cpp/ggml/src/ggml-metal/ggml-metal-ops.cpp` to bypass the
    fp16-storage MUL_MAT path for models with high-magnitude activations.

